$ bimcraft-cli run --cmd 'hydrant_size {}'
[exit 1]
--- stdout

--- stderr
line 1 (hydrant_size): hydrant_size: `type` (1, 2, 3, 4-40, 4-65 or 5) or `column` and `area` is required

$ bimcraft-cli run --cmd 'hydrant_size {"column": 1}'
[exit 1]
--- stdout

--- stderr
line 1 (hydrant_size): hydrant_size: `area` (m², built) is required with `column`

$ bimcraft-cli run --cmd 'hydrant_size {"area": 100}'
[exit 1]
--- stdout

